&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord passion: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re an active Discord user or have deep knowledge of gaming and creator communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;marketing analytics platforms and ads serving infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in &lt;strong&gt;marketplace/inventory analytics or supply-side platform reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python/R skills&lt;/strong&gt; for data manipulation and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of privacy regulations&lt;/strong&gt; (GDPR, CCPA) and their impact on ads measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;attribution methodologies and conversion tracking systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
