&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with Sales, Sales Operations, Tax and Revenue Accounting departments to address issues impacting accounts receivable and coordinate on credit policies.&lt;/li&gt;
